# The full per-cell privacy audit is INTERNAL. It carries n_cards, n_merchants and exact top-1
# shares for the cells the gate suppresses — publishing it would undo the suppression it proves.
# artifacts/privacy-summary.json carries the funnel counts and is safe to publish.
artifacts/privacy-report.json

# The adversarial review is an internal document: it names the specific non-gated cells and their
